        <div class="sec-card-divider"></div>
        <div class="sec-card-body"><h3>Data encryption</h3><p>Encrypted with TLS 1.3 in transit <br class="sec-br sec-br-wide">and <span style="white-space:nowrap">AES-256</span> at rest.<br>Keys are held separately <br class="sec-br">in an HSM.</p></div>
     </div>
      <div class="sec-card">
        <div class="sec-card-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/Security-2.svg" alt="Multitenancy isolation icon" class="sec-card-illust" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;"></div>
        <div class="sec-card-divider"></div>
        <div class="sec-card-body"><h3>Multitenancy isolation</h3><p>Each organization’s data is fully isolated.<br>PostgreSQL RLS and network-level separation <br class="sec-br sec-br-narrow">block cross-tenant access.</p></div>
     </div>
