        <div class="sec-card-body"><div class="sec-card-title-row"><h3>IT/OT boundary security</h3><span class="ot-it-badge"><i class="ph ph-info"></i>Industrial control: manufacturing, energy</span></div><p>One-way transfer from field edge (Silo/Agent) to cloud.<br>Reverse intrusion into control systems <br class="sec-br">is blocked at source.</p></div>
     </div>
      <div class="sec-card">
        <div class="sec-card-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/Security-4.svg" alt="Audit log and RBAC icon" class="sec-card-illust" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;"></div>
        <div class="sec-card-divider"></div>
        <div class="sec-card-body"><h3>Audit Log &amp; RBAC</h3><p>Every API call and task record <br class="sec-br">is stored securely.<br>Role-based access control (RBAC) <br class="sec-br sec-br-wide">enforces least privilege.</p></div>
     </div>
